10 rem ---------------------------------
20 print "LPC11AXX Reset Script"
30 rem ---------------------------------
40 rem probelist
50 p% = probefirstfound
60 rem probeopenbyindex p%
70 rem wireswdconnect p%
80 selectprobecore p% 0
90 cminitapdp this
100 cmhalt this
110 cmwatchset this 0 0x40048000 W
120 cmresetvectorcatchclear this
130 cmvectresetreq this
140 cmwatchclear this 0
150 cmresetvectorcatchset this
160 rem ---------------------------------
170 rem Workaround to unmask interrupts
180 cmwritereg this 20 0
190 rem ---------------------------------
200 end